Package: fastEmbedR
Type: Package
Title: Fast Native UMAP and openTSNE from Precomputed KNN Matrices
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Stefano",
    family = "Caccia",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "tkcaccia@gmail.com")
Author: Stefano Caccia [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Stefano Caccia <tkcaccia@gmail.com>
Copyright: See inst/COPYRIGHTS for the FAISS and Faiss-mlx derived native KNN
    components.
Description: A compact UMAP and openTSNE-style implementation focused on fast
    embeddings from data matrices or precomputed nearest-neighbor index and
    distance matrices. Native float32 CPU HNSW and Apple Metal exact/IVF-Flat
    search support one-call workflows. Optional package-native CUDA search
    links directly to FAISS GPU for exact search and to the RAPIDS cuVS C API
    for IVF-Flat, keeping results on the device for CUDA embedding. Preprocessing, graph or affinity
    construction, fixed-reference transform, and stochastic layout
    optimization use native code with explicit CPU, Metal, and CUDA backend
    reporting.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/tkcaccia/fastEmbedR
BugReports: https://github.com/tkcaccia/fastEmbedR/issues
